			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"text": "TODO\n- Make code uncopiable\n\n--------------------------------\n\nHardware\n- OrangePI (WiFi, GSM, Bluetooth)\n- Screen\n- 2x Cameras\n- Microphone\n- Speaker\n- RfiD sensor\n- 12buttons ka numpad\n\nSoftware\n- Mobile Application\n== Flutter\n- Lift Module\n== Flutter / Electron\n\n--------------------------------\n  \nAuthentication\n- Face ID\n- Voice ID\n- RFiD\n- Passcode   - Uses, Floor(s), Expiry\n- QR Code    - Uses, Floor(s), Expiry\n\nFloor Control\n- Button Panel\n- Voice Recognition\n- Passcode / QR Code (if 1 floor)\n\nOther Controls\n- Lights (On/Off, Color, Brightness)\n- Music (On/Off, volume, mp3 file,\nyoutube link)\n- Announcement (Language [Auto\ntranslates] , volume, voice)\n- ",
			"rawText": "",
